    "detailed_description": "Ragtag Racing is a simple (and hopefully fun) 3D racing game which tries to celebrate the historic vehicles of motorsport along with the mayhem and perils that came with driving them.<br />\r\nRace from last place to a podium position to increase your score and progress to the next track in each series.<br />\r\nStay out of trouble and don't loose momentum, use your boost to get ahead of the pack but make sure you don't run out of fuel.",
